<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="uk">
  <file id="dialogs\support\cc_jkk_receptionist.txt" original="dialogs\support\cc_jkk_receptionist.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I though you said you didn't want this "stupid" job? Get lost.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The man stops typing and looks at you.::

Welcome to JKK headquarters, $(#Mister/Miss)...?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a3" name="=&gt;a3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>$(context.player.Name).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>$(#Mister/Miss) $(context.player.Name), nice to meet you. My name is Van. How can I help you?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a6" name="=&gt;a6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm looking for some work.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Very good. And what kind of work are you looking for?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a8" name="=&gt;a8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Something fun that pays good.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He laughs.:: Aren't we all! Well, if you'd excuse me for a brief moment, I'll see if we happen to have anything available.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Van presses a button on his headset and starts speaking to someone. You pretend not to listen, but you can hear your name being mentioned a couple of times. The man remains almost expressionless, yet you somehow catch that there's something wrong. After several minutes, the conversation ends.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>$(#Mister/Miss) $(context.player.Name), I'm very sorry, but we can't offer you a working position here at JKK at the moment. The reason for this is, if I've been told correctly, that you are already working for a different organization. I apologize again, and wish you a dominating day.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a12" name="=&gt;a12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Thank you for your time. Goodbye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a13" name="=&gt;a13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Well, I didn't even want this stupid job. So long.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Van presses a button on his headset and starts speaking to someone. You pretend not to listen, but you can hear your name being mentioned a couple of times, and also notice that the man nods his head several times, as if he's agreeing with something that's been said. After several minutes, the conversation ends.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Sorry to keep you waiting, but in return, I have some good news: It might seem like a coincidence, but we are in need of a capable individual, and *you* just might be the one. If you're still interested, I'll let you through to Miss Vivian Young. You'll find her right near the entrance, just beyond this door.

And before I forget: You can only move about the first floor of the building. Access to other areas is forbidden to visitors. Just to be clear.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a16" name="=&gt;a16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Thank you. I will go see Miss Young now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a17" name="=&gt;a17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Got it. See ya.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a18" name="=&gt;a18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I don't know, what do you have available?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q19" name="=&gt;q19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We might have something... If you'd excuse me for a brief moment, I'll see if we happen to have anything available.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a20" name="=&gt;a20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I have no idea. Literally.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q21" name="=&gt;q21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Perhaps there is something for you... If you'd excuse me for a brief moment, I'll see if we happen to have anything available.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a22" name="=&gt;a22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>On the other hand, I need to ask you something else.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q23" name="=&gt;q23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Definitely. Ask me anything.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a24" name="=&gt;a24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What can you tell me about JKK?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q25" name="=&gt;q25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>JKK is *the* major broadcasting organization in Core City. We make sure every Arena match is brought to the people of both South and North Underrail. Even the poorest zoners get the chance to experience the brutality of the Arena. &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q26" name="=&gt;q26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Moreover, for those interested in betting on the Arena matches, JKK is the organization responsible for it, and much more. Without JKK, Core City would not be what it is today.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a27" name="=&gt;a27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>So long.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q28" name="=&gt;q28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What's up, $(context.player.Name)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q29" name="=&gt;q29">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">58</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Good day, $(#Mister/Miss) $(context.player.Name). How can I help you?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
</xliff>